  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AIMS ICSU 2015 workshop</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIMS-ICSU 2015 workshop</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AIMS anlitas for en tv&#xe5;dagars workshop i syfte att hj&#xe4;lpa ICSU att ta fram en Logframe f&#xf6;r resultatstyrning .</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">FR&#xc5;GAN HAR &#xc4;NDRATS &#x2013; SE &#xd6;VER DITT SVAR

ICSU in collaboration with Sida is organizing a two-day workshop to develop a log-frame for ICSU
as a whole and to develop impact-oriented approaches to activity planning, monitoring and reporting.
The Workshop will be facilitated by an external facilitator, contracted under the Sida-AIMS framework
agreement. The Workshop is intended to help ICSU in refining its long-term strategic framework in line
with the principles of RBM and in establishing a baseline for future strategic plans, in particular the
2018-2023 Strategic Plan.</narrative>
  </description>
